WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,120
Ah, dig a hole in the ground and use it as a door to warm the house.

2
00:00:03,120 --> 00:00:05,040
Brother Mouchuan, what kind of truth is this?

3
00:00:06,380 --> 00:00:07,420
Remember one thing

4
00:00:08,020 --> 00:00:09,020
Heavy cold air

5
00:00:09,420 --> 00:00:11,260
hot air lightly cooled

6
00:00:11,380 --> 00:00:12,980
Cold is heavier, hot is lighter

7
00:00:14,060 --> 00:00:16,940
What's so special about this? There's a fire in the house.

8
00:00:17,100 --> 00:00:19,940
The hot air floats upward and collects on the inner layer of the roof, but the air conditioner

9
00:00:19,940 --> 00:00:20,900
sink it and go down

10
00:00:21,020 --> 00:00:21,980
Drill to the lowest place

11
00:00:22,060 --> 00:00:23,020
Open the door at the lowest level

12
00:00:23,020 --> 00:00:24,180
It's like being at the bottom of the house

13
00:00:24,180 --> 00:00:25,260
I dug a hole specifically for the air conditioner.

14
00:00:25,340 --> 00:00:26,500
The cold wind coming in from outside

15
00:00:26,620 --> 00:00:27,540
Before it enters the main house

16
00:00:27,540 --> 00:00:28,500
Just fall into this pit first

17
00:00:28,620 --> 00:00:30,140
I'm lying down and can't get up.

18
00:00:30,140 --> 00:00:33,420
Well, that hot air? The hot air is light and floating on top.

19
00:00:33,580 --> 00:00:35,100
Don't go to this low door at all.

20
00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:37,340
So the heater in the house cannot escape.

21
00:00:37,460 --> 00:00:40,140
The air-conditioning outside can't get in. It goes in and out.

22
00:00:40,420 --> 00:00:41,900
They were all blocked by this mouse hole.

23
00:00:42,220 --> 00:00:43,660
This is such a hole

24
00:00:44,100 --> 00:00:45,180
There is such a reputation

25
00:00:49,230 --> 00:00:51,590
This is just like shaking water, water flows downwards

26
00:00:51,590 --> 00:00:53,830
The air conditioner is also lowered and the door is opened lower.

27
00:00:53,910 --> 00:00:55,430
The air-conditioning was poured into the pit and I lay there

28
00:00:55,510 --> 00:00:57,230
You can't get into the place where we sleep.

29
00:00:57,510 --> 00:00:58,470
It's rare that you can figure it out
